# Auto Deploy (GitHub + Vercel)

After completing any site change in this repo, deploy automatically. Do not ask the user for permission to commit, push, or deploy.

## Workflow

1. Finish the requested change.
2. Commit relevant files with a clear message (skip secrets and junk like `.env`).
3. Push to `origin main`: `git push origin main`
4. Deploy to Vercel production: `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes`

## Rules

- Do not ask "Should I deploy?" — just deploy.
- Only commit files related to the task; do not add unrelated untracked files unless the user asked.
- If push or deploy fails, fix and retry once; then report the error briefly.
- Live URLs: GitHub `https://github.com/ali-1825/leadingedge`, Vercel `https://leadingedge-two.vercel.app`
